{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1449,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:345466cbbc5d18722f9b4882",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60cea5bec86c043fd19dbea36436c0f3b9c4fe2202fcdb74cfb046ace865c13f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:047292eb21497664a5c27403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家见识一下小真平日\r\n一点一滴累积的成果吧。\r\n强壮的小真要上场了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5580e9551290fac01e7a61edf66a7c6b918de1ee3553f3c39d517204196c76f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f402dc2ac0bd77ef27a4ede1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以移开视线喔。\r\n因为接下来的每个场面\r\n都会是小真的精彩瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1442e9ac8bf7d5f37a49b3bb61078cd2b36465167e091e4286a02417fede6be4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8e4d7dbc65795d81c3d2744",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60cea5bec86c043fd19dbea36436c0f3b9c4fe2202fcdb74cfb046ace865c13f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6421668f38fc821ece8bbec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a33be5d182910b07f33d048e963b267fea02b8cc4bafdbc2bfce1f5574ee935",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a930e5ce0676b133665578e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "第二名……下次获胜会很有戏剧性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43f8d43718bbf174a4648619e2ae5485a7548cc80252c4fba8a50215b1beb545",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98ee912cec514088fcf396e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还在成长当中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b4b6e467f833f12d6d094b5b45c946469ff9acacb086117f8adad4808a1e670",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fae96dc150d9f37e40630141",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔。我本来以为可以表现得更好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "290eaac8e9be1a41e3d346754a21eb2166656c4f939e9734f18171bd50074296",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dab8fd8c5213fdfcc9f6f18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真下次会用结果来推销自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a144819688eda60a92112dc9c48fbf81745b16aeb4f86e8b52c3a0605c164794",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22bf4f141746a22ada857b19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有跑出令人难忘的表现吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d773f35fddc73e697fde2b1416a175363d216312eb9a499e3e1084637ebb7f0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e60b95eb4003c9b1d01b51f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有感到兴奋或是雀跃吗？有吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a8e7767814c64ae70f2bbc240e037818baf428f41301a77cac365597bf71131",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bcd191bb83ad11fc9b81fd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份甜甜的时光，是否传达到了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "80923b70550632ee0a5c457e78c3247673fec5e632749af6f2bdd11da12128ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3ca35f14dd0fb2c9b17d1a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心跳加速了？心动不已了？对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8aa70b44e507e8175bbc496d925b66c3bdc0ae408de21e31e613643bd909834",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bdff728387a28254b577a75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，我会加油的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e84b25aa3248ad1e2b6ccbbad3d20a38859abffb337db7b7c8cf2a47f3318116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb12636c7688c9ac4c17fda4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以错过我的表现喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b468eb4093af9a371d38cca0267f6b258de894308219dcf31dc9dea9f54aa3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3dee4e4123e8556c0b53069",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要行动，我要前进！\r\n朝着快乐情人节目不斜视地\r\n横步前进。！‌",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb0b458165500b8830494d882bb4f901cd9c860bcb27a7100b49444bad1db45b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17464ec22cd0a8cb6835b1c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真觉得，那个人\r\n其实还挺粗神经的，\r\n所以不用太担心哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "936171ed84f8b286e3869a82aa8b3bfe4a5dd4ae53acd48f780cfa38dc227fa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7993ba86ca69efdb0b118eca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起保持比V状态……\r\n再保持“耶”状态……为了呈现\r\n精彩的抓拍时刻，继续努力锻炼吧！‌",
      "source_fingerprint": "72a2bae8885ff18f392e3bcd8e38e00ed93b3b41d6468938ede9d7ff01943c9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72a650c5e0028db08ecb5d66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "留下，被留下。\r\n在这美好的时代，和大家相遇了。\r\n对于这一切的爱……深表感激。‌",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4b13c7d4e1b79a905d638251028da059bce6aaca648a52ba00ec3323ad6db60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:019f249aa245b926fe4fb632",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所谓的灵感，都需先经过一番耐心\r\n等候才会出现…………叮咚～\r\n小真也想到了新的周边商品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d521de959f7bf41ddbbf450dbb8d4ca7c44347f8e4935f89d1ad679424dcb0a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c69098cdaa13f191238b84d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，小真在这里。\r\n要一直追上来，不可以跟丢喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ed38c5c351c93a1f847ff873b0c57007eee947ff68644b91d55aea16c83a45c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24ab49f01abf5c60e40e3b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "答答答啦～♪答答答啦～♪\r\n答答答答，答答答答～♪\r\n这是来自谬斯的祝福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72958ddb86c7f56e697cbdb3338efcb5ffd7200432b969d45fca47a1fcb4a8a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8e828712094ab279c9cbdc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇……！\r\n一直在一起呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98cac9283cca7d84cc2b48805e31ceb061edcb0540eeca97d837a03a015961bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21cb13e2776210636b515ec4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯♪\r\n她是我最重要的朋友……\r\n无论何时，都能发现我的存在♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e3c574513dfd59d38e4b1e2617cf856793cc7dd0e0554450b9c35d5f90ae2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:548e561189006fe4ed6d987c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是用眼睛或耳朵都好，\r\n尽情感受小真吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "986b55b65580511a8e337e193515c39c35d26445b4927ab14aacc3b4794d2c5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc698bb18a555cadd0dbc5f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要留下许多痕迹，\r\n放心不会痛的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74aa4d0f23726b6427776f7be242995493e28c0f174fe19396094af6fea39174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b407d0ee0edb9685cffc22d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有在好好看着我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "681375461cf0997afff5043839f04a54fa6f0a712bb5b4ba0183c48ac5159fa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:370d5a1b7436ac87ab91c03a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经决定好自传的\r\n第一行要写什么了……\r\n呵呵，训练员你知道答案吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "786c0d5429d1af332a25c82519d927a20d9a099612d484c57eb17f69fac8ce26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c9208914de73b6f7708da75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真穿制服也很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61433ee7b98b140a398586e0216caed5bf7be44a7cdbdf3dadc4dcdf67e8d4e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40bb8d3656937a1a44839ce9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀？要开始练习演唱会吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a40b6aedfc03860a0d31830da09cf74b219a8c42695c6cbe23f90bd8c6e901",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10d9d81256ec8f31d3e5c0f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上这件决胜服，即便在赛场上\r\n也能很容易认出小真了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bccb33a48d0782ac8e28d9360399dff59e3ad079c8faec7980e20dbc040f1f80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:912b750a07526458ea2abe59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每天早上都会烫缎带。\r\n毕竟无法确定什么时候会是我\r\n最后一次拍照嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9647f58d339baa986140f45c2891128d248a0335d0278d5fd7e722065f5706b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec0100bd7885438011d92cd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会就是一场考验，\r\n考验着唱歌跳舞的功力和口才。",
      "source_fingerprint": "036b9f7e86c27a32c0bc5db304ce10ae4a3965e0512452ac5c3b0b1f0e56d19b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8bd4e99bc88cf5b834ff947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是参考我的形象，\r\n只属于我的服装……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6e44a0e8da7ccb0af862bd0f80ec07a5867f27e08ad0af0196ef1188e0ba61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efec5927fb47440a3438c79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要摸一下这件衣服吗？\r\n会让你很难忘的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "37d81280de59dd39d6d87e76243ecf6b80dcce8436338315b0b875e95e9759b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2115a0505f9a08487d2c2119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，其实头冠也是特制的哦。\r\n你看你看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6dfc8e865d2b46501b7baee79eb3ac75f3aec1dd475c1deef8f22102b9cd6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d07e0a236b6c53a29eb849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真的换衣时间～",
      "source_fingerprint": "411fd1b233c3acf73977c43b13316a1a6bb89a474a4afb9e0aa359374313ba80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:598af8bc2d06ba0300309810",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次就用这套服装出周边吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfc016df16c8e567f0300e27660a8296319ad55d1bc6adf3718d35fc232a3608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de47220226c512878892f31d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯~脑袋滋滋的。\r\n没法冷静下来……呼呣。失礼了。\r\n可以借用一下训练员的手吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa3a5cadd0b50cb24fb8fbd39158cef007145c3c5124160712bafd5bbcd116df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d3a77d84db61b235e878f16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服也好决胜服也好私服也好\r\n小真就是小真。\r\n永远都是小真。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e69d4cc8aefd22cd9e7fbcbc096aa0c57962bad181b8fe099c3d7c51fccf6dbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac90876ebf46d2d70640c0c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真穿制服也很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61433ee7b98b140a398586e0216caed5bf7be44a7cdbdf3dadc4dcdf67e8d4e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5c5b30203a05292d30a4755",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀？要开始练习演唱会吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a40b6aedfc03860a0d31830da09cf74b219a8c42695c6cbe23f90bd8c6e901",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c710e7aefa56aa52643fe979",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上这件决胜服，即便在赛场上\r\n也能很容易认出小真了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bccb33a48d0782ac8e28d9360399dff59e3ad079c8faec7980e20dbc040f1f80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:064a0018fcba1ea5362fa8bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每天早上都会烫缎带。\r\n毕竟无法确定什么时候会是我\r\n最后一次拍照嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9647f58d339baa986140f45c2891128d248a0335d0278d5fd7e722065f5706b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7be9e6f424f926034ef99a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会就是一场考验，\r\n考验着唱歌跳舞的功力和口才。",
      "source_fingerprint": "036b9f7e86c27a32c0bc5db304ce10ae4a3965e0512452ac5c3b0b1f0e56d19b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24ade353fb6f0906b7900e98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是参考我的形象，\r\n只属于我的服装……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6e44a0e8da7ccb0af862bd0f80ec07a5867f27e08ad0af0196ef1188e0ba61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2caffe82d7343114f6a69c00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要来摸一下这件衣服吗？\r\n会让你很难忘的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eac4a50dc501e076bc5c7e58df7263c429574e1fb9d9b4ba9835facea16146a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d0f88cbd0993421c426fe9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，其实头冠也是特制的哦。\r\n你看你看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6dfc8e865d2b46501b7baee79eb3ac75f3aec1dd475c1deef8f22102b9cd6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91e2650f0775ac21197a21d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真的换衣时间～",
      "source_fingerprint": "411fd1b233c3acf73977c43b13316a1a6bb89a474a4afb9e0aa359374313ba80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:526737fb57ffad6784090bce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次就用这套服装出周边吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfc016df16c8e567f0300e27660a8296319ad55d1bc6adf3718d35fc232a3608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6fdc11b8b224763ca58b130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4df2ad118acbcd31fc826ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要对决啊，我知道了。\r\n请好好见证小真的奔跑哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c423c8dcbc0b1614931403788a0d17201247bdeeb8e125fc55fd8fd786a5199d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea74bcd37b495df66e65c98b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份实力，毋庸置疑。\r\n那么，作为马娘界的吉祥物，\r\n小真也不会输的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d84b05b3b3b710a4be48457ae86f4c1fd58283e352f0d7e4882c6c0f4a1c0312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad9662dffd99b3d2f3021f75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。一大早的小真也很可爱喔。\r\n请尽情欣赏吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "294a76ad8a6b59c429ae955b64394f93cebccae022ba9c20aa65655fb435afb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4edc2c1e14f7383b8ac2b151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的阳光照起来好舒服。\r\n让人意识到自己今天也有好好起床，\r\n觉得非常幸福呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b09c5d8c5fd7cd5e9167da65f899c6cf00f9ad32b17b18c786b8b9bf86f84934",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9e842d8cae26aef166c06a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啰，训练员。\r\n世界级小真就在这里喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be4fe60534e72737c2237c1d5f886342b653eb57d17e1351371d52eb7b21ffdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f7874282942dbb73859fa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经到午餐时间了吗？\r\n请坐这里吧。大家都说小真的\r\n旁边特别能让人放松呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e38731d37d181a2e728ae6281063a2f9fdfb6d56c870691652afe2a99dcb906e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806b68186c76002df1db07c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，训练员。呵呵呵。\r\n小真是不是闻起来很香啊？\r\n其实我今天已经洗好澡了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f397f004a77f56d81d5c4c32036590a43a9014e26658d08355888f788fa43d5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9b3b3e359dc9a15181c722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天就快结束了。\r\n呵呵，但还没结束，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ecf5adbaae1e3070a119843615ff678f1a84cf607dc6b969ccbeb559bf73cb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2787741a3e8577461dda0f0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，天气变得好暖和喔。\r\n你明天想跟我一起去\r\n晒晒太阳还是散步呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc2647d536797af9f636775a0cbda9a9fd62ff9ee7e801e79a67ec2f8cdf632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84d0d9481e83c6fb188f7c9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉……我现在好想变成麦茶喔。\r\n……请在小真的周围，\r\n放一堆飘浮的冰块吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a84cac5ed9e06cce7fff5a99b0e305b0d11031ebbcf4bd7183bd6ef01f714cf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c94e9b270a5188314674d4a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑外围时看到的柿子树，\r\n又有一棵变成了小真的颜色。\r\n你什么时候才会染上小真的颜色呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a86151b0cbedb95780a3841a9b27c3f04ef789c0f28208736136d86afba9f9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90fd35eeffee63ec1e57f9ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能再多下一点雪吗？\r\n这是制作等身小真雪雕的\r\n好机会……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "729e903c8103c04975bedb92cac37c8b425aa2ce726f5ab7381fca08aad7cfc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19a30f8c7856158e08d9de1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "‌小真的晨间时光。哼哼，有没有\r\n闻到一股甜甜的香气呢？这是\r\n用古龙香水加深印象的作战计划哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faa473b335c89c7fd8b001388260f73c98698f4af6557cc2817fa62f2e5b451f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:945d03f7a0abdcdb3018edc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵、呵、呵，真幸运呢。\r\n早上就开始见面的话，\r\n和小真一起的回忆就会更多呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3af1355a9d63e58e63cef0aedbd5d3bb0dcb633a8a6970669f96b0bd788a06ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c5abeeb7640d7582cc9375c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说有的圈子流行着\r\n从各种马娘照片中找出小真的游戏。\r\n今天午餐时的挑战难度超高哦～‌",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ea72a5862f81da1abcf23e40a9945e03a2405703a1f54b1dd49d5117d7dc2d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bfdc04ac919d76d5952b2e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说今天有杂志社要来采访呢‌。\r\n虽然不像夜讨朝驱那样突然‌，\r\n但这可是突击营业的大好机会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70d3e3b207497e29e08aef2d793201d67455e27a68df508e33f3726a19dc3276",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32112f750605c75ec3a8d700",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然晚上想好好休息一下~\r\n但我想到了新周边的企划，\r\n得趁还没忘记之前整理一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bb2fb94aac355a53216d4e609c3efb539a6e52a0e7a2ffe7209686fe772b62b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d08d436527c35b5d4f90b0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "困了就用棉花糖可可补充糖分。\r\n很有效果很值得推荐。\r\n不过，要适可而止哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3bb25b0cc46b93fa7e7cc60f1e4515b6a8a03e23be09497ddb2cd108388822e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c58c681f19e4b05ad98e50ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蒲公英会乘风旅行。\r\n每个城镇的人们都会记得蒲公英。\r\n……我得好好向它学习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d5af65c2f4f6e8437315f19f34293c5662e3ef7d0b0ceb945a7bdb363861ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ea532f65e841cfffc8cc860",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正拍着刨冰的照片，\r\n眼看着就在强烈的日照下融化了……\r\n那么美味的刨冰……让人有点落寞呢。‌",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a1f14e06676a6d1ff63344b105cf7be507d24abf60e1de98fd987243fb3f22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d532de3244831ad4f45e3e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们去寻找小小的秋天吧。\r\n去创造数不清的回忆，\r\n填满心中的相册。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5247647f1a07f456bbaacaad2d4454e9d216a18334b8c1ec33f7cb0f777f17cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3663ea7d7ea41dcc2da4ca90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在快要下雪的日子里，\r\n我会伸出手仰望天空。\r\n希望自己不会忘记这形状和温度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebfca8678ea9bf1b719ce03df822df65fbd1320563c33b38a5526f9a41a5fc8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b105b37565cadbb2be123edc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3455df99fcdf52dccf9e7b073c56d68f8d34a6868121f5a62cfc4738b1b633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf56a5d13b37f6cd99301c23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3455df99fcdf52dccf9e7b073c56d68f8d34a6868121f5a62cfc4738b1b633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bac8b54e4748e9d9b352415",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是伏特加，\r\n还是赤骥，\r\n小真都会跑在她们前面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2c7d7a477e271cb92f4d55cf77d414721f86c2869848822b5bb099c1785bd54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24534fe0f1bbb18554149f82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真机伶真的是无懈可击。\r\n我只要想去入镜就会被发现，\r\n她还愿意跟我合影呢。耶嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "286e2c811928932fe1f2e8a1c09e973c5ef52b3c19e8a5a98d1e2a84acd373a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a53eb9a4ab438d601ab9b687",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真的爸爸很会开车。\r\n所以小真将来一定也很快就能\r\n考到驾照，很厉害吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "759c07e4f0a3ebbf17c50f2e8e62e540d45e8c0323c656470b38aa0f69b89855",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c62eda5df0ec0152c3e170fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔！这是涡轮师父的脚步声。\r\n听起来……似乎正在被某人追赶！\r\n嗯，还真是备受疼爱呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff490e582ca1d3d6e6cd048e310b9d46b80f13b64ed675fecf95ea9c51293b66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:063865b553dc99672d4aae3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不太喜欢太纯粹的白色。\r\n感觉跟消毒水的味道很像。",
      "source_fingerprint": "695dc759b1e3da248c99cf4498bf30755826a0a2be2eaabea2bf94033852069c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
